  "Percent as a rate per 100": ["Percent", "Percent means \"out of 100\".", ["25% = 25/100 = 0.25.", "50% is one half; 25% is one quarter; 10% is one tenth.", "To find 10% of a number, divide it by 10."], "What is 25% of 40?", ["25% = 1/4.", "40 ÷ 4 = 10.", "25% of 40 is 10."], "Learn the friendly percents: 10%, 25%, 50% and 100%.", { type: "area", rows: 10, cols: 10, grid: true }],
