  "Spelling grade-level words": ["Spelling Strategies", "Use patterns and rules to spell tricky words.", ["Drop the silent e before adding -ing: make → making.", "Double the last consonant for short vowels: run → running.", "Change y to i before -es: city → cities.", "i before e except after c: believe, receive."], "Add -ing to \"hope\".", ["Hope ends in a silent e.", "Drop the e before adding -ing.", "hoping."], "Say the word slowly and spell each sound."],
