  "Theme and summary": ["Theme and Summary", "A theme is the message; a summary tells the main events briefly.", ["Theme is a lesson about life, like \"honesty matters.\"", "Look at how the main character changes to find the theme.", "A summary tells the most important events in order, in your own words.", "Leave out opinions and small details."], "A boy lies to his friend, loses the friendship, then apologizes and earns it back. What is the theme?", ["What does the boy learn?", "Lying hurts friendships; honesty repairs them.", "Theme: honesty builds trust."], "State a theme as a full sentence, not one word."],
