  "Commas in a series": ["Commas in a Series", "Use commas to separate three or more items in a list.", ["Put a comma after each item except the last.", "Put and or or before the last item.", "A comma before and (the serial comma) keeps lists clear."], "Fix: \"We packed apples grapes and cheese.\"", ["There are three items.", "Add commas between them.", "We packed apples, grapes, and cheese."], "Count the items. Three or more? Use commas."],
